<ui version="1">
<!--
  Added in MoH Arena: the "Spectator" HUD style, the layout that the match
  camera films with.

  It is for the spectator side of an objective game alone.  A player on a
  team gets the "Arena" style in its place, from the moment he joins, and so
  does a spectator of any other game mode (CL_UIR_ActiveHudId).

    arena        the top bar, the three feeds and their sizes
                 (ui_om_hud_topbar_scale, ui_om_hud_killfeed_size,
                 ui_om_hud_messages_size, ui_om_hud_chat_size)
    its own      the two player lists, the followed player's name and health
                 and a kill feed with each name in its team's colour

  The player lists are the scoreboard rows: a name on the team's colour while
  the player lives, a skull when he is dead and a white frame on the followed
  player.  A row shows health only on a server that sends it, as mc_on 1 and
  mc_h<client number>.  MoH Arena's servers send it to the match camera's
  slot alone, so every other spectator sees who is alive and no more.

  Left out on purpose: the hint lines of the spectator, the vote prompt, the
  voice menu and the name under the crosshair.

  The rows repeat once for each client number because an expression cannot
  build a variable's name.  This file was made once from the camera's
  generator and is now kept by hand.
-->
<definitions hud-id="spectator" hud-label="Spectator" draw-order="4"
             pause-menu="dm_pause" scoreboard-menu="scoreboard">
